cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Shido in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Shido: publication-quality crystal structure figures and analyses from CIF files"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Takeuchi
    given-names: Kaito
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-26
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Toror0/shido"
abstract: >-
  Shido generates publication-quality crystal structure figures and analyses
  (lattice parameters, bonds, symmetry, polyhedra, structure factors, simulated
  XRD, slabs, Heusler sublattice models, DFT c/a sweeps) from CIF files on
  Windows, with a GUI, a command line and an MCP server. Every run records a
  recipe (versions, arguments and file hashes) so figures can be reproduced.
keywords:
  - crystallography
  - crystal structure
  - CIF
  - pymatgen
  - materials science
  - scientific visualization
  - MCP
